{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l010","ordinal":372462,"en":"My name is Netain."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l011","ordinal":372463,"en":"Kuyaly, my crush"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l012","ordinal":372464,"en":"It was a soul from my land,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l013","ordinal":372465,"en":"injected seven times,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l014","ordinal":372466,"en":"He said he would do it for you."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l015","ordinal":372467,"en":"A girl with a better name is a wrestler,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l016","ordinal":372468,"en":"He reached his inheritance,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l017","ordinal":372469,"en":"Staring is death,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l018","ordinal":372470,"en":"He granted what he wished for."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l019","ordinal":372471,"en":"He killed the one who caught him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l020","ordinal":372472,"en":"He wanted to fight."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l021","ordinal":372473,"en":"Kayipchal's wrestler girl,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l022","ordinal":372474,"en":"You are a girl from the dark sky,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l023","ordinal":372475,"en":"The girl left from the boat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l024","ordinal":372476,"en":"The edge of your village is white,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l025","ordinal":372477,"en":"Shurkuya, who has lost his conscience."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l026","ordinal":372478,"en":"There is no back,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l027","ordinal":372479,"en":"There is no husband who does not pray."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0984:b002:l028","ordinal":372480,"en":"The girl who gave Bekzaada,"}]
